+The second way you can call
+.BR SConscript ()
+is to specify a list of (sub)directory names
+as a
+.RI dirs= subdirs
+keyword argument.
+In this case,
+.B scons
+will, by default,
+execute a subsidiary configuration file named
+.B SConscript
+in each of the specified directories.
