+.TP
+.RI SConscriptChdir( value )
+.TP
+.RI env.SConscriptChdir( value )
+By default,
+.B scons
+changes its working directory
+to the directory in which each
+subsidiary SConscript file lives.
+This behavior may be disabled
+by specifying either:
+
+.ES
